{"unit_id":"smellingtiger__dsh-files-menu#card-zh","repo":"smellingtiger/dsh-files-menu","commit":"8116b8f385359bdea9dff256d26a139e7b3e6ace","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-files-menu 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的工作区文件树右键菜单插件。它通过客户端事件委托识别文件和文件夹行，并为每一行提供打开或展开/折叠操作。用户可以复制绝对路径、相对工作区根目录的路径以及文件名或文件夹名；桌面宿主支持时，还能在文件管理器中显示文件或打开文件夹。菜单支持键盘操作，复制后显示短暂提示，关闭插件时清理界面与监听器。适合经常从 DSH 工作区文件树复制路径或定位文件的用户；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:431-455","client.js:397-423"]}
{"unit_id":"smellingtiger__dsh-files-menu#card-en","repo":"smellingtiger/dsh-files-menu","commit":"8116b8f385359bdea9dff256d26a139e7b3e6ace","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-files-menu adds a context menu to the DSH Web workspace file tree. Right-click files or folders to open, expand or collapse them, or copy paths and names. With desktop support, reveal a file or open a folder in the file manager. Includes keyboard navigation and copy confirmations.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:431-455","client.js:397-423"]}
