{"unit_id":"smellingtiger__dsh-files-menu#feature-1","repo":"smellingtiger/dsh-files-menu","commit":"8116b8f385359bdea9dff256d26a139e7b3e6ace","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-files-menu 的功能「复制路径或名称」：对文件或文件夹右键后，可复制绝对路径、工作区相对路径或最后一段名称；复制结果会显示短暂提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:220-239","client.js:272-276","client.js:406-413"]}
